I left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, so an HTTP import would add authority the node doesn't have. Putting the customer's question into the URL would also send it to an external host on every call. Enrichment belongs in a node that holds an `HTTPClient` scoped to that host, and it should not put the question text in the query string. The implementation below is the node as specified.

