The build failed because `AgentResponse` and `LlmError` are not in scope. They belong to the `types` interface, not the world's `use` list, so they must be imported from `crate::aap::caps::types`.

I did not add the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and the `http-client` interface is not among them, so the component has no import through which to make that request. Sending the raw question to an external host would also leak user input to a service outside this node's authority, so I left it out. If you want it, it needs its own node with an explicit `HTTPClient` capability and a reviewed allowlist.

